            {
                "text": "Added dependent pay (spouse, children, dependent parents) begins at the 30% rating tier. Exact additions vary by tier and dependent type — see the VA rate table for the figures that apply to your household."
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "type": "callout",
        "spans": [
            {
                "text": "Always confirm amounts on VA.gov.",
                "bold": true
            },
